   "en": "Yuichi is a boy with spiritual abilities who embarks on a journey alongside the cat spirit Shou in order to find the remaining memories of his deceased teacher. Though Yuichi avoids humans due to his painful past, the warmth that he encounters from the humans and spirits he meets gradually melts his heart.\n\nWhat is the message that Yuichi's teacher wanted to deliver...?"
